comments.body:
Hi @reporter! I have the same problem which occurs exactly after 5 minutes. Initially I though the problem was due to liveness/readiness probes, but after increasing those I saw that the last line in the log is:

{"action":"startup","error":"bootstrap: context deadline exceeded","level":"fatal","msg":"could not open cloud meta store","time":"2024-07-27T08:29:35Z"}

Have you been able to find a workaround? Fresh install resolves the issue however I need my indexes.
